# Allow-list build context: only what the image build needs.
# Everything else (git history, venvs, tests, infra code, local DBs, keys) stays out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!requirements.lock
!src/
!src/**

# Never ship bytecode caches or editor junk even if they live under src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
